1
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,000
Mr. Jiang has ordered

2
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:08,800
that all of you go see him.

3
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,319
Mr. Jiang invited us.

4
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,639
Is it really necessary to make such a fuss?

5
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:16,879
You carry a lot of weight, Mr. Qin.

6
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,759
We worried that with too few men,

7
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,400
you wouldn't come with us.

8
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,159
Take them away.

9
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,280
Let's go.

10
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,719
Mr. Jiang.

11
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,240
Everyone is here.

12
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,360
You've truly honored me by coming.

13
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,560
Please, sit.

14
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,000
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

15
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,400
Mr. Ma.

16
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:21,960
No need to rush to explain.

17
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,599
What matters most

18
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:25,280
is that you made it out alive.

19
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:30,680
Everyone,

20
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:33,680
you should know very well

21
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:36,360
why I invited you here today.

22
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:38,319
Mr. Jiang,

23
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:42,879
my husband and I were finally reunited.

24
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,919
We'd like to return home as soon as possible.

25
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,919
Returning home? That won't be easy.

26
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,639
As long as we can get back to China,

27
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,039
I doubt Country M's police

28
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,879
can cross the border to arrest us.

29
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,479
I recall you mentioned before

30
00:03:58,479 --> 00:04:01,000
that Mr. Zhuang owes a large sum to loan sharks.

31
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:04,439
If you two just head back like this,

32
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:08,719
will that really solve the problem?

33
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:10,000
But...

34
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,319
Let's hear what Mr. Jiang has to say first.

35
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,280
What do you think he can say?

36
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:14,759
You've already taken a wrong turn.

37
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:16,160
I don't want you to keep making mistakes.

38
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,720
In this world,

39
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,240
there are only sides.

40
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,639
Who's to say what's right or wrong?

41
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,279
Miss Ge,

42
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:25,720
think about yourself.

43
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,199
To save your husband,

44
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:30,360
you defied the laws of Country M

45
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,360
and broke him out of prison.

46
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:38,000
Was what you did right or wrong?

47
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,319
All right.

48
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:45,199
The reason I invited you all

49
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,560
to take part in my business

50
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,680
is that Mr. Thiradet and I believe

51
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,519
you're all exceptional talents.

52
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,759
For talents like you,

53
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,120
if you were to keep living

54
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,560
an ordinary life,

55
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:59,160
that would be such a waste.

56
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:03,639
Mr. Ma,

57
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:07,199
our business can resume now, right?

58
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,560
Of course.

59
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,040
Brother Xiao Zhuang,

60
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:15,519
we've braved a hail of bullets together.

61
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:18,360
We're just doing business together.

62
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,920
There's nothing to be afraid of.

63
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:23,360
Mr. Ma,

64
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,759
if we hadn't saved you,

65
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:27,240
you might still be in prison.

66
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:29,839
I hope you can honor that debt of gratitude

67
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,759
and not drag my husband down this path again.

68
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:32,879
What do you know?

69
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,519
Brother Ma saved my life in prison!

70
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,000
And our successful prison break this time

71
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,800
was all thanks to Brother Ma and Mr. Qin.

72
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:40,040
I don't care what you think.

73
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:42,000
When I say no, I mean no!

74
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:43,839
Do you think everyone in this world

75
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,000
has a choice?

76
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,199
Let me tell you,

77
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:48,000
I had no choice a long time ago!

78
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,759
What do you mean?

79
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:57,240
I'm already working for Mr. Jiang.

80
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,439
I didn't tell you because I didn't want you to worry.

81
00:06:10,319 --> 00:06:11,040
Let her go.

82
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:19,879
Mr. Zhuang,

83
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:24,279
you need to decide whether to stay or go.

84
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,079
Stay.

85
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,639
But I have to explain things to my wife.

86
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,439
Don't bother going.

87
00:06:31,399 --> 00:06:33,120
She won't listen to anything you say right now.

88
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,279
Let me go talk to her for you instead.

89
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:01,639
All right.

90
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:04,920
Now that the women are gone,

91
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:07,920
we can get down to men's business.

92
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:18,319
Are you afraid your man will take the wrong path,

93
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:21,439
or afraid he won't come back to you?

94
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:27,839
I used to be just like you.

95
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,199
I always thought the path he walked

96
00:07:29,199 --> 00:07:30,439
was a road of no return.

97
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,160
But in truth, every life is a one-way road.

98
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:37,160
Everyone faces death in the end.

99
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:39,319
But I don't want him to die so young.

100
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:41,720
If Brother Rong hadn't

101
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,360
saved your husband in prison,

102
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,600
he might never have walked out.

103
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:49,240
Danger is everywhere in life.

104
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:50,920
Instead of worrying every day,

105
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,600
you might as well learn to let it go.

106
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,959
Have you really never

107
00:07:55,959 --> 00:07:57,199
worried about him?

108
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,480
If I worry too much,

109
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,600
it'll only get in his way.

110
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,040
I'm his woman.

111
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:07,120
Why burden him with my worries?

112
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,160
At the end of the day,

113
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,680
a woman can't stop a man from doing what he wants.

114
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,120
Rather than tying his hands,

115
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,199
it's better to let him be free

116
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:17,680
to do what he wants.

117
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:23,839
I often pray at temples

118
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,439
just to send all my best blessings

119
00:08:26,439 --> 00:08:27,319
to him.

120
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,480
I love Brother Rong,

121
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:33,440
so whatever decision he makes,

122
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,639
I'm willing to support him.

123
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,639
You saw it for yourself just now.

124
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,240
Your husband has already made

125
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:41,759
his choice.

126
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,759
The only choice you have now

127
00:08:44,639 --> 00:08:45,799
is to stay by his side

128
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,559
or walk away.

129
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,840
What you choose

130
00:08:49,399 --> 00:08:50,559
depends on whether

131
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,840
you value him

132
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,000
more than yourself.

133
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,240
And you?

134
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:58,200
Are you willing to live on edge your whole life?

135
00:09:00,399 --> 00:09:02,320
Brother Rong already has a plan.

136
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,480
In a few years,

137
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:06,759
we'll find a way to settle abroad.

138
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:08,519
From then on, we'll live

139
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:10,879
a peaceful and quiet life.

140
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:15,879
When the time comes,

141
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:17,080
you and your husband should join us.

142
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:20,440
We can keep each other company in a foreign land.

143
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:26,759
All right.

144
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:31,759
Mr. Ma.

145
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,399
To be honest,

146
00:09:33,639 --> 00:09:35,360
I never expected

147
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:38,000
that you'd actually make it out.

148
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,039
That goes to show

149
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:42,240
Mr. Thiradet's judgment was spot on.

150
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,759
I was just lucky.

151
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:47,320
It was mostly thanks to Old Qin.

152
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,159
We're in the same boat.

153
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,720
If anything happened to you,

154
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:53,240
I wouldn't be able to face Mr. Jiang.

155
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,960
Rest assured, Mr. Jiang.

156
00:09:57,559 --> 00:10:00,679
I'll repay my debt as soon as possible.

157
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,120
It's just a small sum.

158
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:06,679
Consider it a welcoming gift for you, Mr. Ma.

159
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,919
Then thank you, Mr. Jiang.

160
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:16,960
Since we'll be working together from now on,

161
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,519
I think we ought to

162
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:20,399
trust each other more.

163
00:10:20,879 --> 00:10:24,120
Mr. Jiang, regarding my wife...

164
00:10:27,679 --> 00:10:29,960
That was merely

165
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,679
a little test for you, Mr. Ma.

166
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:36,200
Since we've never worked together before.

167
00:10:37,039 --> 00:10:38,279
I can assure you

168
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,080
that from now on,

169
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:41,399
your family will be kept out of this.

170
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,080
Thank you.

171
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:48,720
In fact, your survival

172
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:51,279
was entirely Mr. Thiradet's call.

173
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,480
To tell you the truth,

174
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,159
The Four Great Families of Country M

175
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,240
have been keeping

176
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:57,000
far too close an eye on Mr. Thiradet.

177
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:58,360
Mr. Thiradet

178
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,559
has had no chance whatsoever

179
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:01,039
to get involved in the family businesses.

180
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:04,159
As for me, I'm tied down at the factory.

181
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:05,559
We really need you all

182
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:07,799
to help us open up new distribution channels.

183
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,440
From this point on,

184
00:11:09,759 --> 00:11:11,200
I don't want you all to be

185
00:11:11,559 --> 00:11:14,440
just Jiang Liye's downlines.

186
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,320
You'll be my business partners.

187
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,879
The profit margin I offer you

188
00:11:17,919 --> 00:11:21,320
is far higher than a regular downline's.

189
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,039
How about it?

190
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,559
Any objections?

191
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,320
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

192
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:36,600
Good.

193
00:11:37,879 --> 00:11:40,559
Here's to a fruitful partnership.

194
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:55,080
The suspect's name is Gao Jian.

195
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,639
Into Liang Wenbiao's injection,

196
00:11:56,679 --> 00:11:58,559
he put a heavy dose of purified narcotics,

197
00:11:58,919 --> 00:12:00,679
which causes sudden cardiac arrest.

198
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:02,759
Take Gao Jian's trace evidence right away

199
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:03,360
and send it to forensics.

200
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:03,759
Yes, sir.

201
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:05,159
Bring Gao Jian in for questioning.

202
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:05,759
Understood.

203
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:17,639
Do you recognize him?

204
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:26,120
The Dongshan Park murder case...

205
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:26,879
You know about it, right?

206
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,960
I killed them.

207
00:12:28,559 --> 00:12:29,480
You're quite straightforward.

208
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:30,799
But why do I feel

209
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,600
you couldn't pull this off alone?

210
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:36,000
And you're probably not the mastermind, either.

211
00:12:38,559 --> 00:12:39,399
At the scene,

212
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,919
we found footprints from three different people.

213
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,159
And under the victim's fingernails,

214
00:12:43,519 --> 00:12:45,519
there's skin tissue from two other killers.

215
00:12:47,039 --> 00:12:47,960
Did you think

216
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:50,320
that destroying trace evidence on the body

217
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:52,000
would keep us from identifying them?

218
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,399
Through Deoxyribonucleic acid testing,

219
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,679
we can still identify the victim.

220
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,360
And on the victim's body,

221
00:12:58,399 --> 00:12:59,240
if there is any of the killer's

222
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:00,480
Deoxyribonucleic acid left behind,

223
00:13:00,639 --> 00:13:02,600
we can still find out who the killer is.

224
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,840
Deoxyribonucleic acid?

225
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,480
You mean a man's semen, right?

226
00:13:08,399 --> 00:13:09,360
Saying all that

227
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:11,120
is completely pointless.

228
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,360
It won't change anything,

229
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,679
won't help anyone,

230
00:13:14,279 --> 00:13:15,600
and won't take the fall for anyone.

231
00:13:15,679 --> 00:13:16,840
I did it alone.

232
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,240
It has nothing to do with Brother Four.

233
00:13:18,679 --> 00:13:19,320
Brother Four?

234
00:13:22,919 --> 00:13:23,720
Four-Legged Snake?

235
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,919
I never mentioned Four-Legged Snake.

236
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,759
So it was Four-Legged Snake who teamed up with Liang Wenbiao.

237
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,279
Criminal Investigation just called.

238
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:39,320
Liang Wenbiao admitted his ties to Four-Legged Snake.

239
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,159
Didn't he refuse to say anything before?

240
00:13:42,279 --> 00:13:43,960
He knows Four-Legged Snake wants to kill him,

241
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,200
so why would he let him get off easy?

242
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,759
Now, only from Gao Jian's mouth

243
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,840
can we find Four-Legged Snake's location.

244
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,879
I'm not Four-Legged Snake's man.

245
00:13:55,039 --> 00:13:56,600
I just do the job for money.

246
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,840
I know nothing about his business.

247
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,240
You do the job for money?

248
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,559
What kind of job?

249
00:14:02,399 --> 00:14:03,279
Kill people for him.

250
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,519
Since I've been caught,

251
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,200
I have nothing left to say.

252
00:14:09,559 --> 00:14:10,759
The crimes to my name

253
00:14:11,679 --> 00:14:13,000
would get me executed several times over.

254
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,879
Then why didn't you run after the killing?

255
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:17,159
I was planning to run,

256
00:14:17,559 --> 00:14:19,720
but I never expected you'd find me so fast.

257
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,159
What about Four-Legged Snake?

258
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:23,159
He's running too.

259
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,120
But he said

260
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,840
he'd take us to meet his boss first,

261
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:30,399
then take us to the US to lay low.

262
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:32,240
And this boss he mentioned,

263
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,799
is he called Chameleon?

264
00:14:33,919 --> 00:14:34,879
Maybe.

265
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:36,840
But I've been wondering...

266
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:39,879
Isn't Chameleon just Four-Legged Snake?

267
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:44,440
What kind of person is this Chameleon?

268
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:45,440
I don't know.

269
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,080
All I know is

270
00:14:47,159 --> 00:14:49,240
Four-Legged Snake calls him Chameleon,

271
00:14:50,039 --> 00:14:51,840
and on the phone, he calls him Brother Long.

272
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,080
The deaths of Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying

273
00:14:54,279 --> 00:14:56,360
directly clear Chen Hai of suspicion.

274
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,559
Could Chameleon actually be Chen Hai?

275
00:15:03,919 --> 00:15:06,200
We'll talk about you and Four-Legged Snake later.

276
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,879
First, tell us...

277
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,679
where Four-Legged Snake is hiding.

278
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,279
If I wanted to talk, I would've by now.

279
00:15:11,679 --> 00:15:13,799
You caught me, I'll take the hit.

280
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,480
Why would I sell out my own people?

281
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:16,399
Your own people?

282
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,200
Even now,

283
00:15:19,559 --> 00:15:20,519
do you really think

284
00:15:20,799 --> 00:15:22,360
they still see you as one of them?

285
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:29,600
You must know Guo Yingying and Zhang Xuebin.

286
00:15:31,759 --> 00:15:33,879
They were also once what you called

287
00:15:33,919 --> 00:15:34,960
"one of our own."

288
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:36,879
And look what happened to them.

289
00:15:37,279 --> 00:15:38,840
Do you want to end up just like them?

290
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,840
That outfit of yours...

291
00:15:42,159 --> 00:15:43,720
can sacrifice at any moment

292
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,879
the very people you call "one of your own."

293
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:48,240
I never said Four-Legged Snake was one of my guys.

294
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:49,919
He's just my boss.

295
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:52,000
I was only passing through Nanhai.

296
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,720
None of them here are my brothers.

297
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,320
It's just that two of my guys

298
00:15:58,159 --> 00:15:59,840
are with Four-Legged Snake right now.

299
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,480
If I give up Four-Legged Snake,

300
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:04,200
wouldn't I be selling them out?

301
00:16:04,279 --> 00:16:05,720
Those two guys you mentioned...

302
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:06,720
They're the ones who pulled the job with you

303
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,960
at Dongshan Park, right?

304
00:16:12,759 --> 00:16:13,840
Chief Huang was right.

305
00:16:14,159 --> 00:16:15,840
This criminal syndicate appears loose,

306
00:16:16,039 --> 00:16:17,360
plagued even by infighting,

307
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:18,720
but in truth, it's tightly organized.

308
00:16:18,759 --> 00:16:20,320
When trouble brews, any manipulation

309
00:16:20,639 --> 00:16:23,200
creates massive roadblocks for our case.

310
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,639
No matter how tight their ranks,

311
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:31,960
we'll find a weakness.

312
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:38,960
What I'm about to say

313
00:16:39,759 --> 00:16:41,279
is my personal confession.

314
00:16:43,559 --> 00:16:44,879
In everyone's eyes,

315
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:48,320
I'm an executive at Zhongtian Logistics

316
00:16:49,159 --> 00:16:50,879
with a happy family.

317
00:16:52,279 --> 00:16:54,159
But what no one knows is,

318
00:16:55,399 --> 00:16:57,399
beneath the mask of an ordinary man,

319
00:16:57,799 --> 00:17:00,120
lies the identity of a criminal.

320
00:17:01,399 --> 00:17:02,399
Two years ago,

321
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:05,599
I met drug trafficker Cheng Weimin.

322
00:17:06,079 --> 00:17:07,039
He told me

323
00:17:08,319 --> 00:17:09,960
drug dealing was fast money.

324
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:12,319
Blinded by greed,

325
00:17:13,319 --> 00:17:15,359
I used my position at Zhongtian...

326
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,119
Looks like for now,

327
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:22,240
we won't be able to make him talk.

328
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,480
Well? Did you find anything?

329
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:28,880
What do you think?

330
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,680
The kid claimed he was just passing through Nanhai

331
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:32,519
and had no buddies there.

332
00:17:32,799 --> 00:17:33,839
Which means

333
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:36,920
he must've met those two partners in Jincheng.

334
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:40,799
In Nanhai, I tracked down Qian Feng,

335
00:17:41,079 --> 00:17:44,519
along with downlines Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

336
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:53,519
Guan Qiang, make a trip to Jincheng.

337
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:54,319
Yes, sir.

338
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:01,440
Captain Bai.

339
00:18:01,559 --> 00:18:02,720
Zhou Fuhai didn't commit suicide.

340
00:18:03,839 --> 00:18:04,599
Are you sure?

341
00:18:05,279 --> 00:18:05,759
Positive.

342
00:18:10,559 --> 00:18:11,599
Lately,

343
00:18:12,359 --> 00:18:14,279
my conscience has been tormenting me.

344
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:16,519
I let down my family

345
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:18,400
and the leaders who trusted me.

346
00:18:19,319 --> 00:18:20,519
The mistakes I made

347
00:18:21,519 --> 00:18:23,160
can no longer be undone.

348
00:18:23,599 --> 00:18:25,720
I can only atone with my death.

349
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:28,839
What are you getting at?

350
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:31,160
I finally found what's wrong with this recording.

351
00:18:31,759 --> 00:18:33,640
When someone commits suicide to escape guilt,

352
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,920
they're bound to feel intense inner turmoil.

353
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:37,400
They might feel remorse,

354
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:39,720
internal struggle, or hesitation,

355
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,319
or even become incoherent.

356
00:18:41,839 --> 00:18:43,519
Yet in Zhou Fuhai's recording,

357
00:18:43,839 --> 00:18:46,039
his speech flows smoothly and his breathing is steady.

358
00:18:46,079 --> 00:18:48,039
There isn't a single hesitation from start to finish.

359
00:18:49,319 --> 00:18:50,559
It doesn't sound heartfelt.

360
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,759
It sounds more like he's reading a suicide note.

361
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:56,680
If Zhou Fuhai had actually written a suicide note,

362
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,599
he wouldn't need to record it all over again.

363
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:02,319
I didn't really believe it was suicide either.

364
00:19:03,799 --> 00:19:06,240
If the note wasn't written by him at all,

365
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:07,759
then Zhou Fuhai's death

366
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,480
is very likely...

367
00:19:10,079 --> 00:19:10,960
homicide.

368
00:19:11,119 --> 00:19:13,559
Right. The killer is extremely cunning.

369
00:19:14,039 --> 00:19:14,680
He knew

370
00:19:14,799 --> 00:19:16,960
that if he made Zhou Fuhai write a suicide note,

371
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:19,160
Zhou Fuhai might well use it

372
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:21,680
to leave us clues through his handwriting.

373
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,480
Little did he know

374
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,200
that this very recording

375
00:19:25,359 --> 00:19:27,599
would instead give away the truth.

376
00:19:28,039 --> 00:19:30,119
The killer's real motive

377
00:19:30,119 --> 00:19:30,960
for making Zhou Fuhai record this

378
00:19:31,039 --> 00:19:32,359
was simply to sever

379
00:19:32,359 --> 00:19:34,039
any connection between Chen Hai and Zhou Fuhai.

380
00:19:34,279 --> 00:19:35,599
If Zhou Fuhai's death

381
00:19:36,519 --> 00:19:38,319
wasn't done by Four-Legged Snake's men,

382
00:19:38,319 --> 00:19:41,359
then the most likely suspect is...

383
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,079
Hu Dong.

384
00:19:42,599 --> 00:19:43,559
Besides,

385
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,119
the Shanxi police already confirmed:

386
00:19:45,319 --> 00:19:47,200
Hu Dong never returned to his hometown.

387
00:19:49,359 --> 00:19:50,200
You're right.

388
00:19:50,519 --> 00:19:52,880
We'll soon be meeting Chen Hai again.

389
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:57,279
Head back to the crime scene once more

390
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,400
and see if there are any new clues.

391
00:19:58,680 --> 00:19:59,160
Yes, sir.

392
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,319
Every time I arrive at a crime scene,

393
00:21:06,119 --> 00:21:08,039
I imagine the entire crime playing out.

394
00:21:08,759 --> 00:21:10,880
If I were the killer, what would I do?

395
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:01,640
Is this property management?

396
00:23:47,519 --> 00:23:49,160
Hello, how can I help you?

397
00:23:49,759 --> 00:23:50,279
Excuse me,

398
00:23:50,359 --> 00:23:52,200
who was on duty on Thursday night?

399
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:54,519
Just a moment, let me check for you.

400
00:24:01,119 --> 00:24:03,400
Master Li was on duty on Thursday night.

401
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:04,759
Is he around right now?

402
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:05,240
Yes, he is.

403
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:06,920
I'll go get him for you. Please wait.

404
00:24:16,799 --> 00:24:17,799
I realized

405
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,599
that I've reached the end of the line.

406
00:24:21,599 --> 00:24:22,559
All this time,

407
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:25,400
my conscience has been tormented.

408
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:28,480
I've let down my family

409
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:30,319
and the superiors who trusted me.

410
00:24:32,359 --> 00:24:33,480
The mistakes I've made

411
00:24:34,559 --> 00:24:36,160
can no longer be undone.

412
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:40,920
I can only atone through my death.

413
00:24:48,559 --> 00:24:49,000
What do you think?

414
00:24:49,400 --> 00:24:50,400
Right at the end,

415
00:24:51,039 --> 00:24:52,480
there's a sound like rustling paper.

416
00:24:52,759 --> 00:24:53,640
Although it's very faint,

417
00:24:54,279 --> 00:24:55,599
through audio isolation,

418
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:56,799
it can still be identified.

419
00:24:58,640 --> 00:25:01,039
Add in the footsteps at 1:37,

420
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,799
and we can basically confirm

421
00:25:03,559 --> 00:25:04,599
that before Zhou Fuhai died,

422
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:06,079
he definitely wasn't alone.

423
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:14,960
This is Master Li.

424
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:15,519
I'll leave you to it.

425
00:25:15,799 --> 00:25:16,839
Hello, Officer.

426
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:18,400
What can I do for you?

427
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:19,880
I'd like to ask you about

428
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,519
Zhou Fuhai from Room 308.

429
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:25,079
Actually, property management

430
00:25:25,119 --> 00:25:27,240
posted a water shutoff notice by the elevators,

431
00:25:27,359 --> 00:25:29,200
but that night, lots of people still called

432
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,200
to ask about the shutoff.

433
00:25:30,519 --> 00:25:31,519
Room 308 called too.

434
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,160
He had quite a temper.

435
00:25:33,559 --> 00:25:34,599
He said he was in the shower

436
00:25:35,119 --> 00:25:36,920
and told me to fix the water right away.

437
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:38,920
Just as I was about to explain,

438
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,000
he hung up the phone.

439
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:44,599
Are you sure he hung up?

440
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:49,400
Sorry...

441
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:51,720
Well, he just suddenly stopped talking.

442
00:25:52,200 --> 00:25:52,960
After a moment,

443
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:54,200
hearing no response from him,

444
00:25:54,519 --> 00:25:55,759
I hung up the phone.

445
00:25:58,039 --> 00:25:59,119
Then did you happen to hear

446
00:25:59,119 --> 00:26:00,240
any other sounds?

447
00:26:00,319 --> 00:26:01,759
Or rather, did you hear

448
00:26:01,759 --> 00:26:02,799
anyone else's voice?

449
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:06,240
Anyone else's voice?

450
00:26:06,279 --> 00:26:07,039
Let me think...

451
00:26:12,039 --> 00:26:13,839
It seemed like someone came to his place.

452
00:26:14,279 --> 00:26:17,640
He called him Ah Dong or something.

453
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,759
Right, it was Ah Dong.

454
00:26:23,559 --> 00:26:24,960
Please take me to the surveillance room to check.

455
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:25,440
Sure, sure.

456
00:26:25,519 --> 00:26:26,200
Come, this way please.

457
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,400
Pause it.

458
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,279
Do we have a clear shot of his face?

459
00:26:53,279 --> 00:26:54,960
This is the clearest clip we have.

460
00:26:59,039 --> 00:26:59,920
Please take all the footage of him

461
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:01,359
entering and leaving the building

462
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:02,400
and copy it for me.

463
00:27:02,519 --> 00:27:02,960
All right.

464
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:18,880
We'll wait for Li Xiao.

465
00:27:27,920 --> 00:27:28,480
Captain Bai.

466
00:27:28,559 --> 00:27:29,880
Traffic police reported back that

467
00:27:30,119 --> 00:27:31,160
on the day Hu Dong took leave,

468
00:27:31,359 --> 00:27:32,799
he never left Nanhai at all.

469
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:42,400
Captain Bai, we can confirm it's homicide.

470
00:27:42,440 --> 00:27:43,599
The killer is someone named A-Dong.

471
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:45,319
I think it's that Hu Dong.

472
00:27:48,839 --> 00:27:49,839
Meet at Chen Hai's place.

473
00:27:50,880 --> 00:27:52,039
Let's pay him a visit.

474
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:52,799
Yes, sir.

475
00:28:32,119 --> 00:28:33,400
Calling me out this late...

476
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,240
you're not expecting me

477
00:28:35,279 --> 00:28:36,440
to watch the sunrise with you, are you?

478
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:40,440
You're looking in good spirits, Mr. Chen.

479
00:28:41,039 --> 00:28:43,480
Seems like you took care of Zhou Fuhai.

480
00:28:45,319 --> 00:28:46,680
If I didn't deal with Zhou,

481
00:28:47,079 --> 00:28:48,359
would I still have a foothold in Nanhai?

482
00:28:48,559 --> 00:28:49,680
Out with it. What's this really about?

483
00:28:51,319 --> 00:28:52,640
I'm not the one who asked to meet.

484
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:54,359
It was someone else.

485
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,119
Captain Bai.

486
00:29:06,559 --> 00:29:07,480
Chen Hai isn't home.

487
00:29:07,799 --> 00:29:08,880
His car isn't in the parking lot either.

488
00:29:09,079 --> 00:29:10,759
I had He Bo pull the surveillance footage.

489
00:29:17,839 --> 00:29:18,680
We got the footage.

490
00:29:37,039 --> 00:29:38,200
1:30 a.m.

491
00:29:39,319 --> 00:29:40,119
This late at night,

492
00:29:40,839 --> 00:29:42,119
he's definitely up to something.

493
00:29:50,119 --> 00:29:51,200
Contact traffic police.

494
00:29:51,480 --> 00:29:52,519
Use the road surveillance

495
00:29:52,839 --> 00:29:54,160
to track down this vehicle.

496
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:54,720
Understood.

497
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:09,559
All right, got it.

498
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:10,440
You head back first.

499
00:30:14,079 --> 00:30:14,640
Captain Lu.

500
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:18,920
What do we have?

501
00:30:20,279 --> 00:30:20,799
This house...

502
00:30:20,839 --> 00:30:22,599
was left to Chen Hai's daughter by his mother.

503
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:24,960
It looks like a shootout between them.

504
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:27,240
Both have gunshot residue on their hands,

505
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,799
and nitrogen compounds on their bodies.

506
00:30:28,799 --> 00:30:30,799
Only their fingerprints were found on the gun.

507
00:30:31,559 --> 00:30:32,960
Did anyone nearby hear gunshots?

508
00:30:35,359 --> 00:30:37,319
This area is slated for demolition.

509
00:30:37,640 --> 00:30:39,000
Most of the residents have already moved out.

510
00:30:39,519 --> 00:30:41,039
There are no eyewitnesses at the scene.

511
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:44,880
We only expected Chen Hai might be silenced,

512
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:46,000
never thinking

513
00:30:46,039 --> 00:30:47,519
Hu Dong would end up dead too.

514
00:30:56,079 --> 00:30:57,799
I also think too many things don't add up.

515
00:30:58,119 --> 00:30:58,960
But unfortunately,

516
00:30:59,119 --> 00:31:00,359
there is too little evidence at the scene.

517
00:31:04,039 --> 00:31:05,920
Hu Dong did so much for Chen Hai.

518
00:31:06,519 --> 00:31:09,000
They wouldn't kill each other.

519
00:31:09,799 --> 00:31:11,880
Have Forensics run a ballistics test.

520
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:13,119
See if there are any new leads.

521
00:31:20,680 --> 00:31:21,240
Captain Lu.

522
00:31:21,319 --> 00:31:22,599
We found Gao Jian's two close friends,

523
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:23,759
Zhang Buzhen and Ma Zili.

524
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:25,839
I'll send over their files right away.

525
00:31:26,240 --> 00:31:26,640
Okay.

526
00:31:27,119 --> 00:31:27,480
Okay.

527
00:31:29,839 --> 00:31:31,039
Guan Qiang has a new lead.

528
00:31:31,119 --> 00:31:32,000
Send it to the station right away.

529
00:31:32,519 --> 00:31:33,079
Let's head back to the station.

530
00:32:09,279 --> 00:32:10,519
I've been thinking for a long time,

531
00:32:11,599 --> 00:32:14,519
and I can't find a single reason to kill you.

532
00:32:16,519 --> 00:32:18,480
Is this how Fourth Brother does business?

533
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:20,799
When a boss goes back on his word,

534
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:22,680
how can your men

535
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:24,240
follow you with peace of mind?

536
00:32:28,839 --> 00:32:30,839
Goading me won't work.

537
00:32:31,640 --> 00:32:33,920
While I can't find a reason to kill you,

538
00:32:34,519 --> 00:32:37,519
you'd better come up with

539
00:32:37,920 --> 00:32:39,599
a reason for me not to.

540
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,000
Think carefully.

541
00:32:42,759 --> 00:32:44,559
Cherish this chance.

542
00:32:55,519 --> 00:32:58,000
The man on the left in the photo is Ma Zili.

543
00:32:58,200 --> 00:32:59,359
The one on the right is Zhang Buzhen.

544
00:32:59,799 --> 00:33:01,799
They're Gao Jian's childhood friends.

545
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:05,000
Six months ago, Gao Jian came to Nanhai.

546
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:05,880
Shortly after that,

547
00:33:06,079 --> 00:33:07,279
both of them also

548
00:33:07,279 --> 00:33:08,000
left Jincheng.

549
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:09,720
I think the two of them

550
00:33:09,759 --> 00:33:11,319
are the ones Gao Jian mentioned,

551
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:13,319
the two guys with Four-Legged Snake.

552
00:33:13,839 --> 00:33:15,160
Gao Jian said he's just passing through

553
00:33:15,599 --> 00:33:17,079
and plans to leave Nanhai.

554
00:33:17,839 --> 00:33:19,920
Now that Chen Hai and Hu Dong are dead,

555
00:33:21,319 --> 00:33:23,440
if Four-Legged Snake did it,

556
00:33:24,599 --> 00:33:26,799
they'll be leaving Nanhai very soon.

557
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:28,640
Right now, the most important thing

558
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,759
is finding their hideout.

559
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:32,799
Maybe we can check with real estate agencies

560
00:33:33,319 --> 00:33:35,759
for recent short-term rental records.

561
00:33:35,759 --> 00:33:36,920
We might find something.

562
00:33:37,799 --> 00:33:40,200
Have all officers call the agencies.

563
00:33:40,519 --> 00:33:42,599
Check the IDs of these three men

564
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:44,319
to see if there are any rental records.

565
00:33:44,599 --> 00:33:48,119
Focus on suburban houses and villas.

566
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:48,720
Understood.

567
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:49,640
Wait.

568
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,920
When Four-Legged Snake escaped last time,

569
00:33:52,920 --> 00:33:54,119
the car he hijacked

570
00:33:54,279 --> 00:33:55,720
was abandoned in Luyang New Village.

571
00:33:56,519 --> 00:33:58,000
His current hideout

572
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:00,079
shouldn't be far from there.

573
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:01,160
Got it.

574
00:34:03,279 --> 00:34:04,799
Ding Tao, stay and help out.

575
00:34:05,039 --> 00:34:05,440
Understood.

576
00:34:06,039 --> 00:34:07,720
We'll go on standby at Luyang New Village.

577
00:34:14,679 --> 00:34:16,079
Do you know someone named Gao Jian?

578
00:34:16,159 --> 00:34:18,280
His ID number is 1440389...

579
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:24,480
Hello, is this the agency?

580
00:34:31,079 --> 00:34:31,599
Found it!

581
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:34,760
I'll send the location to Captain Bai first.

582
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:36,000
Nice work!

583
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,440
Captain Bai?

584
00:34:39,599 --> 00:34:40,320
We found the location.

585
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:44,199
Brother Four, what do you think?

586
00:34:44,880 --> 00:34:47,000
I say we just get rid of this kid first.

587
00:34:58,639 --> 00:34:59,239
How about it?

588
00:34:59,679 --> 00:35:02,400
Want to come abroad with me and see the world?

589
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:09,360
Boss Jiang wanted me to kill you.

590
00:35:10,119 --> 00:35:11,760
And I couldn't bring myself to do it.

591
00:35:14,199 --> 00:35:14,880
But...

592
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:16,360
I can't just...

593
00:35:16,360 --> 00:35:18,119
let you go just like this, can I?

594
00:35:22,199 --> 00:35:23,599
Do I even have a choice?

595
00:35:25,480 --> 00:35:26,360
Untie him.

596
00:35:31,760 --> 00:35:33,480
We're heading to Jiangyang soon.

597
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:35,119
Call Gao Jian.

598
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,079
See how things are going over there.

599
00:35:41,760 --> 00:35:42,199
Hello,

600
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:44,639
the number you dialed is turned off.

601
00:35:44,639 --> 00:35:45,679
His phone is off.

602
00:35:48,599 --> 00:35:50,000
Damn it. Something's wrong.

603
00:35:50,519 --> 00:35:52,199
Pack your things. Let's get out of here!

604
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:53,960
Brother Four,

605
00:35:54,639 --> 00:35:56,440
we agreed to wait for Brother Jian to get back.

606
00:35:58,119 --> 00:35:59,519
If you keep stalling here,

607
00:35:59,559 --> 00:36:01,000
it'll be too late, you hear me?

608
00:36:01,159 --> 00:36:02,119
If you want to leave, go ahead.

609
00:36:02,440 --> 00:36:03,559
I'm waiting for Brother Jian.

610
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:07,719
Staying here is suicide!

611
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:08,639
Do you understand?!

612
00:36:09,440 --> 00:36:09,880
Brother Four,

613
00:36:10,360 --> 00:36:11,760
the two of us answer to Brother Jian.

614
00:36:12,159 --> 00:36:12,760
If he doesn't come back,

615
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:14,079
we're not going anywhere.

616
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:23,800
The police will be here any minute!

617
00:36:24,039 --> 00:36:25,000
Forget these two idiots.

618
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:25,559
Let's go.

619
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:26,320
Move.

620
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:32,079
Hurry up!

621
00:36:35,119 --> 00:36:35,639
Get in the car!

622
00:36:40,519 --> 00:36:41,639
You are surrounded!

623
00:36:42,079 --> 00:36:43,039
Drop your weapons!

624
00:36:44,719 --> 00:36:45,519
Come out and surrender!

625
00:37:04,679 --> 00:37:05,800
Everyone inside the vehicle, listen up!

626
00:37:06,719 --> 00:37:08,320
We're giving you one last chance!

627
00:37:09,199 --> 00:37:10,480
Step out of the vehicle right now!

628
00:37:11,719 --> 00:37:13,039
Drop your weapons and surrender!

629
00:37:13,559 --> 00:37:14,119
What do we do?

630
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:41,320
Why didn't we bring him?

631
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:42,440
There was no time.

632
00:37:42,639 --> 00:37:44,159
If we delayed, none of us would escape.

633
00:38:06,079 --> 00:38:06,519
After them!

634
00:38:15,119 --> 00:38:17,079
The cops probably set up a roadblock ahead.

635
00:38:17,599 --> 00:38:18,679
We can't keep driving.

636
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:19,920
Get out.

637
00:38:38,400 --> 00:38:39,039
Head up the mountain.

638
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:53,559
Hurry up.

639
00:39:09,599 --> 00:39:10,320
Captain Bai,

640
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:13,800
are you worried about Wei Kai?

641
00:39:16,159 --> 00:39:17,320
Don't worry.

642
00:39:17,719 --> 00:39:19,119
We made that chase look convincing.

643
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:21,039
They won't suspect him at all.

644
00:39:21,800 --> 00:39:23,079
Who would've thought?

645
00:39:23,639 --> 00:39:25,840
Wei Kai actually joined Four-Legged Snake.

646
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:27,360
Still, now that he's gone,

647
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:30,000
who knows what new complications might arise.

648
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:43,760
Two days ago,

649
00:39:43,960 --> 00:39:46,559
we found the bodies of Chen Hai and Hu Dong.

650
00:39:46,559 --> 00:39:48,039
Judging by the crime scene,

651
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:50,400
it seemed they had killed each other.

652
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:53,159
But after Forensics ran ballistics,

653
00:39:53,320 --> 00:39:54,719
we discovered new discrepancies.

654
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:55,920
Li Jing.

655
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:02,519
Based on where Chen Hai and Hu Dong fell,

656
00:40:02,679 --> 00:40:04,480
we tested the bullet trajectories.

657
00:40:05,320 --> 00:40:06,239
The results revealed

658
00:40:06,239 --> 00:40:07,880
that the bullet entry angles

659
00:40:08,159 --> 00:40:10,199
and their fallen positions and postures

660
00:40:10,360 --> 00:40:11,440
show a clear discrepancy.

661
00:40:12,480 --> 00:40:13,719
So our conclusion is

662
00:40:14,199 --> 00:40:15,320
that after committing the crime,

663
00:40:15,440 --> 00:40:17,239
the killer deliberately staged the scene.

664
00:40:17,360 --> 00:40:18,079
Clearly,

665
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:20,519
the criminals

666
00:40:20,519 --> 00:40:22,360
are trying to mislead us once again.

667
00:40:22,360 --> 00:40:25,280
And the prime suspect in this case

668
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:27,400
is a man known as Four-Legged Snake.

669
00:40:27,599 --> 00:40:29,280
During his time in Nanhai,

670
00:40:29,719 --> 00:40:31,519
he not only expanded his network,

671
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:33,960
but also threatened Qian Feng,

672
00:40:34,039 --> 00:40:35,119
targeted Li Qiang,

673
00:40:35,280 --> 00:40:38,559
and murdered Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

674
00:40:39,719 --> 00:40:41,920
I just received the latest intel:

675
00:40:42,599 --> 00:40:44,559
he'll soon arrive in Jiangyang

676
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:45,800
to meet up with Xiang Nan.

677
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:48,199
If we follow this lead,

678
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,079
I believe

679
00:40:49,559 --> 00:40:52,519
Xiang Dong, alias Piyazi,

680
00:40:52,679 --> 00:40:53,679
won't be far from our reach.

681
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:54,880
Captain Lu,

682
00:40:55,119 --> 00:40:56,639
please brief everyone

683
00:40:56,760 --> 00:40:58,000
on the other details you have.

684
00:41:00,559 --> 00:41:01,320
Two days ago,

685
00:41:01,360 --> 00:41:03,280
I found a voice recorder in the parking lot.

686
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:04,159
Forensic analysis confirmed

687
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:05,760
it was recorded by Zhou Fuhai himself.

688
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:06,679
Before his death,

689
00:41:06,760 --> 00:41:08,360
he feared something might happen to him,

690
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:10,000
so he made this recording.

691
00:41:10,280 --> 00:41:11,480
In the recording, he mentioned

692
00:41:11,760 --> 00:41:13,000
Chen Hai using him

693
00:41:13,039 --> 00:41:15,159
to infiltrate Zhongtian Logistics.

694
00:41:15,400 --> 00:41:17,760
Across Zhongtian Logistics from top to bottom,

695
00:41:18,159 --> 00:41:20,480
from the GM to the admin assistant,

696
00:41:20,719 --> 00:41:22,039
down to the parcel inspectors,

697
00:41:22,320 --> 00:41:23,119
a total of eight people are involved.

698
00:41:23,360 --> 00:41:25,280
They are currently being interrogated.

699
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:26,480
Meanwhile,

700
00:41:26,719 --> 00:41:27,480
our anti-drug squad,

701
00:41:27,519 --> 00:41:28,920
through months of investigation,

702
00:41:29,079 --> 00:41:29,920
is currently arresting

703
00:41:30,159 --> 00:41:32,800
Chen Hai and Liang Wenbiao's drug network.

704
00:41:33,440 --> 00:41:34,760
We hope to take the shortest time

705
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:37,039
to round up all these drug traffickers.

706
00:41:39,159 --> 00:41:40,559
In addition to the leads

707
00:41:40,559 --> 00:41:41,599
we have already gathered,

708
00:41:41,920 --> 00:41:43,679
Section Chief Zhou has some new updates

709
00:41:43,880 --> 00:41:44,880
to share with everyone.

710
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:48,360
Comrades, first I want to commend

711
00:41:48,440 --> 00:41:49,639
our anti-drug squad.

712
00:41:50,159 --> 00:41:51,719
In the shortest possible time,

713
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:54,800
you cracked several major drug trafficking cases

714
00:41:55,159 --> 00:41:57,960
and dealt a heavy blow

715
00:41:58,280 --> 00:42:00,159
to the Piyazi gang's syndicate in Nanhai.

716
00:42:00,280 --> 00:42:02,880
On behalf of the province and city bureau,

717
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:05,480
I thank you for your hard work.

718
00:42:07,039 --> 00:42:09,679
Furthermore, we must clearly realize

719
00:42:10,079 --> 00:42:12,599
that criminals are like weeds:

720
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:14,079
if not uprooted completely,

721
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:15,760
they will grow right back.

722
00:42:16,119 --> 00:42:18,320
Right now, major criminal Li Qiang

723
00:42:18,360 --> 00:42:19,239
is still at large,

724
00:42:19,400 --> 00:42:21,440
and he has taken our citizen hostage.

725
00:42:21,639 --> 00:42:23,440
We must solve this case swiftly

726
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:26,320
to ensure the hostage's safe return.

727
00:42:27,599 --> 00:42:28,599
The hostages I'm referring to,

728
00:42:29,000 --> 00:42:31,280
besides Ms. Tian Xin, who was taken by Li Qiang,

729
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:32,199
include another person.

730
00:42:32,559 --> 00:42:33,159
Xiao Zhang,

731
00:42:33,679 --> 00:42:36,039
pull up Professor Du Guangming's case file.

732
00:42:40,199 --> 00:42:40,920
Look here, everyone.

733
00:42:41,599 --> 00:42:44,239
A leading figure in our nation's chemical research,

734
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:46,280
of Nanhai University's Chemical Institute,

735
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,480
Professor Du Guangming.

736
00:42:47,639 --> 00:42:48,559
Two weeks ago,

737
00:42:48,760 --> 00:42:50,039
he was invited to Country M

738
00:42:50,039 --> 00:42:51,239
to attend an academic conference,

739
00:42:52,199 --> 00:42:54,119
but went missing during the event.

740
00:42:54,400 --> 00:42:55,719
Subsequent investigations reveal that

741
00:42:56,119 --> 00:42:59,159
Professor Du Guangming was abducted.

742
00:42:59,840 --> 00:43:01,039
Interpol

743
00:43:01,559 --> 00:43:02,760
has focused its suspicions

744
00:43:02,920 --> 00:43:04,400
directly on the Piyazi crime syndicate.

745
00:43:04,480 --> 00:43:07,039
The Chinese Embassy in Country M

746
00:43:07,480 --> 00:43:09,039
is currently urging Country M police

747
00:43:09,119 --> 00:43:10,519
to solve this case as soon as possible.

748
00:43:10,599 --> 00:43:13,239
We attach great importance to this case

749
00:43:13,239 --> 00:43:14,159
and have decided to dispatch

750
00:43:14,320 --> 00:43:15,840
an experienced, top-notch officer

751
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:17,920
to assist Country M police with the investigation.

752
00:43:18,199 --> 00:43:19,360
Previous investigations indicate that

753
00:43:19,719 --> 00:43:22,840
Li Qiang will meet up with Ma Jingrong in Country M.

754
00:43:22,960 --> 00:43:24,559
Comrade Li Xiao is now instructed,

755
00:43:25,159 --> 00:43:26,079
while in Country M

756
00:43:26,320 --> 00:43:28,320
investigating Ms. Tian Xin's whereabouts,

757
00:43:28,920 --> 00:43:31,440
to also execute the special mission

758
00:43:31,679 --> 00:43:33,079
of rescuing Professor Du Guangming.
